{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.BalancedCarrierJacobi"],"declarations":22,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_zero_eq_swMoment","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_zero_eq_swMoment","kind":"theorem","line":268,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L268-L274","doc":"**A-1, the audit claim: the displayed `α`, `β` ARE the Jacobi data of\nthe SW moment sequence.** `(Mⁿ)₀₀ = v^{C(n,2)} = G_n` at every order —\nthe `i = 0` corollary of the main induction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_eq_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_eq_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L183-L266","doc":"**THE MAIN INDUCTION (general `n`, `i`; sorry-free).** The closed form\nfor the iterated Jacobi vector of the SW data:\n\n    (Mⁿe₀)_i = v^{C(n,2) + 2·C(i,2)} · ∏_{j=1}^{i}(v^{m+j} − 1),  n = i + m.\n\nProved by induction on `n`; the four cases are `i = 0`, and `i+1` with\n`m ∈ {0, 1, ≥2}` (the last two need one and two steps of bottom\nextraction respectively). Conjectured from the audit's symbolic sweep\n(depth ≤ 8); established here at every order. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_eq_zero_of_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_eq_zero_of_lt","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L167-L179","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.vRise_eq_qRise","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.vRise_eq_qRise","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L148-L163","doc":"**Bridge to the carrier frame.** `∏_{j=1}^{i}(v^{m+j} − 1)\n= (v − 1)^i · [m+1]_v⋯[m+i]_v`: the SW rising product is the carrier\nrising q-factorial rescaled by `(v − 1)` per step. This is why the SW\nclosed form below and the carrier closed form of\n`BalancedCarrierJacobi.jacobiVec_eq_closed_form` have the same shape. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.vRise_succ_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.vRise_succ_left","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L137-L146","doc":"Bottom extraction: `∏_{j=1}^{i+1}(v^{m+j} − 1)\n= (v^{m+1} − 1)·∏_{j=1}^{i}(v^{m+1+j} − 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.vRise_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.vRise_succ","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L134-L135","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.vRise_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.vRise_zero","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L132-L132","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.vRise","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.vRise","kind":"def","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L127-L130","doc":"`vRise v m i = (v^{m+1} − 1)(v^{m+2} − 1)⋯(v^{m+i} − 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_succ_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_succ_succ","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L120-L123","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_succ_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_succ_zero","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L117-L118","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_zero_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_zero_succ","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L115-L115","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_zero_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec_zero_zero","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L113-L113","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swVec","kind":"def","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L108-L111","doc":"`swVec v n i = (Mⁿe₀)_i` — the iterated Jacobi vector. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swStep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swStep","kind":"def","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L102-L106","doc":"One application of the monic Jacobi matrix `M` (diagonal `α_i`,\nsuperdiagonal `1`, subdiagonal `β_i`) to a coordinate vector. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swMoment_one_base","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swMoment_one_base","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L98-L100","doc":"`q → 1` degeneration of the moments: `G_n ≡ 1`, the moments of `δ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swBeta_one_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swBeta_one_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L93-L96","doc":"`q → 1` degeneration of the off-diagonal: at `v = 1` every `β`\nvanishes — the SW Gaussian collapses to a point mass. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swBeta_zero_val","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swBeta_zero_val","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L90-L91","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swBeta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swBeta","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L86-L88","doc":"**SW Jacobi off-diagonal** — `swBeta v k` is `β_{k+1} = v^{3k}(v^{k+1} − 1)`,\nindex-shifted by one so that no `k − 1` appears. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swAlpha","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swAlpha","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L79-L84","doc":"**SW Jacobi diagonal** `α_k = v^{k−1}(v^k(1+v) − 1)`, written\nsubtraction-free in the index (`α_0 = 1` is the `k = 0` value of the\ndisplayed formula, whose `v^{−1}` cancels). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swMoment_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swMoment_one","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L76-L77","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swMoment_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swMoment_zero","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L73-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swMoment","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SWCoreJacobi.swMoment","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SWCoreJacobi.lean#L67-L71","doc":"**The SW core moment sequence** `G_n = v^{C(n,2)} = v^{n(n−1)/2}` —\nthe moments of the log-normal `LN(−L/2, L)` at `L = ln v`, i.e. the\nGaussian factor of the KSel-2-ID factorization\n(`SWJacksonMomentFactorization.balancedNormalizer_mul_one_sub_pow`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}